  "notes": "Versioned files below are source fragments retained in Git for traceability and build composition. Pages compiles them into canonical current bundles. Entity 360 keeps the approved six-lens dossier, the 0447 persistent RLS autocomplete workspace, 0448 route authority, and 0449 adds governed SII document-authorization observations. Territory 0450 adds the governed CEAD three-layer threat analytics and compact map layout. Reconciliation 0446 keeps reversible cross-filters and no visible UAF × SII bubble matrix. Session stability remains passive and refresh-token lifecycle remains exclusively under the Supabase client. 0460 stage 1 adds append-only analyst disposition capture (aml_disposition), percentile-calibrated score bands from aml_v0460_score_calibration, and self-hosted supabase-js with script-src reduced to 'self'. 0470 adds the identity validation queue: aml_sanction_identity_validation (append-only), aml_v0470_identity_validation_queue, a Trabajo nav group and the validation route. Confirming identity records analyst evidence and does not promote identity in aml_sanctions. 0480 separates the discovery queue from context: aml_finding_role is a governed catalog of the analytical role of each finding type, aml_v0480_discovery_queue is entity-grained and excludes visibility artifacts from prioritisation without deleting them, and the Trabajo group gains the discovery route. 0490 removes the discovery and validation queue sections: the application is not a case-management tool, so entity-grained work queues are out of scope. Nav returns to Explorar/Radares/Analisis. Entity 360 disposition capture and percentile score bands stay.",
